#   3) /elite_ber <kun> (reply) — istalgan foydalanuvchiga qo'lda, muddatli
#      PRIME (VIP) berish — mavjud grant_elite_days() ustiga qurilgan,
#      shuning uchun sotib olingan PRIME bilan TO'LIQ mos (muddatlar qo'shiladi).
# ================================================================================

